| Flat BI | (b) | a1,a2,a3,H1,H2,H3,epsilon,p,n,T (10) | 8 | 2 | 10 | 1 | Determined |
| Flat BI | (c) | a1,a2,a3,H1,H2,H3,epsilon,p,n,T (10) | 8 | 2 | 10 | 1 | Determined, specified regular F |
